    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frostline \u2014 The Last Communication Bridge in the Grip of the Ice Age</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a frozen world gripped by the Ice Age, you take on the responsibility and importance of managing the last telephone station in the city center of the Western Region. Amid an unrelenting struggle between the government and a secret organization, you are the final link controlling communications and identifying wanted criminals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duty is to carefully listen to incoming visitors, monitor both their face-to-face statements and phone conversations, decide who may communicate according to strict government orders, and block those who violate the rules. Your moral choices shape the fate of the region and your own conscience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detect contradictions and suspicious behaviors in customer dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the complex power dynamics between the government and the secret organization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify and neutralize wanted criminals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions lead to different endings\u2014every choice matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive, story-driven communication simulation set in an atmospheric 3D environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frostline</strong> is a unique experience depicting a communication war in a cold and harsh era. As the last remaining telephone station in the city, become a bridge of hope for families cut off by the ice \u2014 survive through your words.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frostline \u2014 The Last Communication Bridge in the Grip of the Ice Age</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a frozen world gripped by the Ice Age, you take on the responsibility and importance of managing the last telephone station in the city center of the Western Region. Amid an unrelenting struggle between the government and a secret organization, you are the final link controlling communications and identifying wanted criminals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duty is to carefully listen to incoming visitors, monitor both their face-to-face statements and phone conversations, decide who may communicate according to strict government orders, and block those who violate the rules. Your moral choices shape the fate of the region and your own conscience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detect contradictions and suspicious behaviors in customer dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the complex power dynamics between the government and the secret organization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify and neutralize wanted criminals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions lead to different endings\u2014every choice matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive, story-driven communication simulation set in an atmospheric 3D environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frostline</strong> is a unique experience depicting a communication war in a cold and harsh era. As the last remaining telephone station in the city, become a bridge of hope for families cut off by the ice \u2014 survive through your words.</p>",
    "short_description": "In a world gripped by the Ice Age, you manage the last telephone station in the city. Listen to incoming visitors and grant or deny communication according to government orders. Your decisions shape the fate of the region. An atmospheric, story-driven communication simulation: Frostline!",
